# SGLang v0.5.23 /metrics (--enable-metrics, SGLANG_ENABLE_METRICS_DEVICE_TIMER=1)
# as prometheus_client writes it: names, help and labels from
# python/sglang/srt/observability/metrics_collector.py and
# managers/scheduler_components/metrics_reporter.py at that tag. One TP rank
# serves Qwen/Qwen3-8B (bf16, 36 layers of 8 KV heads of 128) with an EAGLE
# draft; the pool holds 400,000 tokens of 147,456 bytes plus one page.
